{"fields":[{"t":"B","v":"false","n":"HasIntroAudio"},{"t":"A","v":"intro","n":"IntroAudio"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasPromptAudio"},{"t":"A","v":"prompt","n":"PromptAudio","s":"Les 8 marques de papier toilette qui me font craquer"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio0"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_0_hint","n":"ClueAudio0","s":"What's more gentle on your tender bottom than Cupid's touch?"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio1"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_1_hint","n":"ClueAudio1","s":"Ok, what's with the bears? Can someone explain it to me?"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio2"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_2_hint","n":"ClueAudio2","s":"It's named after a fabric, but it's not a fabric. Is it?"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio3"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_3_hint","n":"ClueAudio3","s":"This is Walmart's line of in-house products, so I hope it's as great a bargain as it says it is."},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio4"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_4_hint","n":"ClueAudio4","s":"Imagine someone's grandmother knitting THIS toilet paper while doing your business... in the north."},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio5"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_5_hint","n":"ClueAudio5","s":"One is named after Coscto's personal brand, but it does sound like my friend Kirk's backyard."},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio6"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_6_hint","n":"ClueAudio6","s":"Ok, this one is literally just a guy's name. Really, am I being pranked?"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio7"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_7_hint","n":"ClueAudio7","s":"These bears are too rare and beautiful for us to be naming our bathroom tissue after them!"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio8"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_8_hint","n":"ClueAudio8","s":"You know the one: eco-friendly, has a leaf for a logo, probably more comfortable than an actual leaf."},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasFollowupAudio"},{"t":"A","v":"followup","n":"FollowupAudio","s":"Unfortunately, every slice you win will be single-ply for this one."},{"t":"B","v":"false","n":"HasOutroAudio"},{"t":"A","v":"outro","n":"OutroAudio"}]}
